name: Palette — more hand size
author: corpus
description: >-
  Palette gives +1 Hand Size again, stacking with Paint Brush. Tier-2 voucher: requires Paint
  Brush bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases: hand size,
  Baron Mime, held-in-hand scaling, Stuntman offset.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: Palette
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Mime
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Stuntman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
